<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<xs:schema xmlns:xs="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">

<!--
Alabama Appellate Courts - Publications List API Response
==========================================================

This XSD documents the JSON API response structure from the Alabama
appellate courts publications endpoint.

API Endpoint:
https://publicportal-api.alappeals.gov/courts/cms/publications

Query Parameters:
- courtID: Court GUID (e.g., "68f021c4-6a44-4735-9a76-5360b2e8af13")
- page: Page number (0-indexed)
- size: Number of results per page (typically 25)
- sort: Sort order (e.g., "publicationDate,desc")

Response Format: JSON

The response contains a paginated list of publication/release lists.
Each publication contains multiple publication items (individual cases/opinions).

Example Response Structure:
{
    "_embedded": {
        "results": [
            {
                "publicationUUID": "abc123...",
                "courtID": "3",
                "courtAbbreviation": "Alabama Supreme Court",
                "publicationNumber": "SC-RELEASE-2023-11-09",
                "scheduledDate": "2023-11-09T14:15:00.000+00:00",
                "publicationItems": [
                    {
                        "publicationItemUUID": "def456...",
                        "caseInstanceUUID": "ghi789...",
                        "caseNumber": "SC-2023-0123",
                        "groupName": "Stewart, C.J.",
                        "title": "Ex parte State (Appeal from Mobile Circuit Court: CC-2022-901234)",
                        "decision": "Reversed and Remanded.",
                        "documents": [
                            {
                                "documentLinkUUID": "jkl012...",
                                "documentName": "Decision",
                                "documentType": "Opinion"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        ]
    },
    "_links": {
        "self": {"href": "..."},
        "first": {"href": "..."},
        "last": {"href": "..."}
    },
    "page": {
        "size": 25,
        "totalElements": 100,
        "totalPages": 4,
        "number": 0
    }
}

Publication List Structure:
- Each result represents a weekly "Release List"
- Release lists are grouped by scheduled date
- Within each release, items are grouped by authoring judge/justice (groupName)

Publication Item Fields:
- caseNumber: Official case number (e.g., "SC-2023-0123")
- groupName: Authoring judge/justice, "Per Curiam", or "On Rehearing"
- title: Case name with optional lower court info in parentheses
- decision: Outcome text (e.g., "Affirmed", "Reversed and Remanded")
- documents: Array of documents (typically one "Decision" document)

Lower Court Information:
- Extracted from title parenthetical
- Format: "(Appeal from <court name>: <case number>)"
- Example: "(Appeal from Mobile Circuit Court: CC-2022-901234)"
- Multiple case numbers may be present: "CC-2022-901234 and CC-2022-901235"

Special Cases:
- groupName="Per Curiam": Opinion authored by the court (no individual judge)
- groupName="On Rehearing": Opinion is a rehearing decision
- Empty documents array: Opinion not yet available (skip)

Document Download URL Pattern:
https://publicportal-api.alappeals.gov/courts/{court-guid}/cms/case/{case-guid}/docketentrydocuments/{doc-guid}

Important Notes:
- Documents filed on/after March 20, 2022 are available
- Opinions before May 19, 2023 are at judicial.alabama.gov (different system)
- Document viewing requires registration, but metadata is public
- The scraper processes only the first (most recent) publication to get current data

Scraper XPath Assertions:
========================

Since this is a JSON API, there are no XPath assertions.
The scraper uses json.loads() to parse the response.

Required JSON Fields:
- _embedded.results[].publicationUUID
- _embedded.results[].scheduledDate
- _embedded.results[].publicationItems[].caseNumber
- _embedded.results[].publicationItems[].title
- _embedded.results[].publicationItems[].documents[].documentLinkUUID
- _embedded.results[].publicationItems[].caseInstanceUUID

Optional JSON Fields:
- _embedded.results[].publicationNumber
- _embedded.results[].publicationItems[].groupName
- _embedded.results[].publicationItems[].decision
- _embedded.results[].publicationItems[].publicationItemUUID

Data Extraction:
- date_filed: Extracted from scheduledDate (ISO 8601 format)
- case_name: Extracted from title, with lower court info removed
- lower_court: Extracted from title parenthetical using regex
- lower_court_number: Extracted from title parenthetical using regex
- authoring_judge: From groupName (empty if "Per Curiam" or "On Rehearing")
- per_curiam: True if "curiam" in groupName (case insensitive)
- on_rehearing: True if "On Rehearing" in groupName
-->

<xs:annotation>
    <xs:documentation>
        This is a documentation-only XSD for the Alabama Publications API.
        The actual response is JSON, not XML.
    </xs:documentation>
</xs:annotation>

</xs:schema>
